{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## /rebar-debug Phase 1 re-confirmed on current origin/main (ae203145fa39) — operator APPROVED scope, entering Phase 2\n\nRe-ran orientation on a fresh worktree off origin/main @ ae203145fa39 (Step 0(a): existing ticket = this one, in_progress; 0(b): reported-against floor is pre-56e130ff, suspect lines unchanged since; 0(c): worktree == origin/main).\n\n**Mechanism (unchanged, still present):** `fsck` derives the JSON `issue_count` as `len(issues)` in `_transform_json` (src/rebar/_commands/fsck.py), counting EVERY emitted `KIND:` line, while the exit code comes from `_scan`'s is_issue-respecting tally. Never-counted kinds — `push_pending`, `status_fork_resolved`, `tracker_dirty_tmp_event`, and all `warn` lines — inflate the JSON count but not the exit code. Second sub-defect: an uninitialised store renders in JSON byte-identically to a clean one (`_missing_tracker_result` → `{issues:[],fixed:[],issue_count:0}`).\n\n**Defect origin (attribution):** `issue_count = len(issues)` decoupled from the counted tally was introduced by commit `56e130ff7132` \"feat(tier-e): port fsck in-process (E4)\" — ticket **scaly-bleat-haul**. Will be recorded via `--caused-by` on close (class: plan_defect — the in-process port shipped the divergent count as its plan, no prior working behavior to regress).\n\n**Disposition:** operator has APPROVED the three-surface design (redefine `issue_count` = counted subset agreeing with the exit code; add additive per-issue `counted` boolean keeping `issues[]` complete; make the uninitialised-store payload distinguishable). Proceeding to Phase 2 (RED→GREEN). Full plan in the ticket description."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787955761002589001,"uuid":"4f422cb0-7480-49c5-9b00-59f685ca09ed"}